{"seq":3,"slug":"networking","title":"网络协议与优化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protocol-design","title":"网络协议设计","url":"/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/protocol-design","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-compensation","title":"延迟补偿（服务器端）","url":"/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/latency-compensation","wordCount":1797,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"bandwidth-optimization","title":"带宽优化","url":"/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/bandwidth-optimization","wordCount":1681,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 网络协议与优化\n\n本章深入服务器与客户端之间的通信管道。协议选型（TCP / UDP / WebSocket / 自定义可靠 UDP）直接决定延迟下限，延迟补偿技术（服务器端回滚）决定高 ping 玩家是否还能公平游戏，带宽优化（Delta 压缩、兴趣区域过滤、量化）决定服务器能同时服务多少玩家。\n\n三篇文档从协议设计的抉择开始，过渡到延迟补偿的服务器端实现（与客户端预测形成对偶），最后讲解如何在有限带宽下把更多信息塞进更少的字节。\n"}